      "text": "⚡ Core API (FastAPI Cluster)\nUvicorn Async Multi-Worker\n\n🛡️ Middleware:\n• Auth: JWT Bearer (python-jose)\n• Role-based Access Control\n• CORS Middleware\n• Prometheus /metrics\n• Pydantic Schema Validation\n\nControllers:\n• Auth, Workspace, Channels\n• Chat WebSocket (/ws/channels/*)\n• Telemetry & Devices (IoT)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
